{"id": "86306", "name": "הפרדת משתנים – √(a−x²)·y′ = x(y+b), פתרון כללי (ב) (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Solve the following differential equation:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}\\frac{dy}{dx}-x(y+{{CT:1}})=0\\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>Use the letter c to denote the arbitrary constant occurring in the general solution.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( y(x) = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-root\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:left\">How to enter: a square root as <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(...)</code>, e.g. <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(5*x)</code>. Other roots as a power, with brackets around the exponent: \\(\\sqrt[3]{x+1}\\) is entered as <code dir=\"ltr\">(x+1)^(1/3)</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> separate the variables, integrate the right-hand side with a substitution, and solve for \\(y\\).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Separating the variables</b><br>For the equation<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}\\frac{dy}{dx} -x(y+ {{CT:1}}) = 0 \\]</p>rearranging gives<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\frac{dy}{y+ {{CT:1}}} = \\frac{xdx}{{CT:0}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — A substitution on the right</b><br>To integrate, let <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u = {{CT:2}}-x^2\\)</span> giving <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(du = -2x\\,dx\\)</span><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\int \\frac{dy}{y+ {{CT:1}}} = \\int\\frac{-du}{2{{CT:3}}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Integrating and solving for y</b><br>Hence<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ln(|y+{{CT:1}}|) = {{CT:4}}+c \\]</p>and<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ y + {{CT:1}} = {{CT:5}} = {{CT:6}}=c{{CT:7}} \\]</p>Hence<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ y = c{{CT:7}}-{{CT:1}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "studentderivcheck:ev(diff(ans1,x)/(ans1+n2),simp);", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "studentderivcheck", "tans": "check2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T ", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">Your answer satisfies the differential equation, but is not in the desired simplest format.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["check2", "correctanswer", "n1", "n2", "wronganswer1", "wronganswer2", "wronganswer3"], "nvariants": 48}